  <p class="kick">Plan 02 &middot; Revised after the baseline audit</p>
  <h1>Growth &amp; Authority Engine</h1>
  <p class="sub">The useful half of the old Plan 02, the whole of Plan 03 that survived scrutiny, and the three things nobody had scoped at all &mdash; at less than the Plan 03 price.</p>

  <div class="pricehead">
    <div class="l">
      <p>Eighteen deliverables across five workstreams, plus three bonus items included at no charge. Four things that were quoted in the original Plan 02 and Plan 03 are <strong>gone</strong> &mdash; either the site already had them, or the Foundation Fix you have already paid for covers them.</p>
