        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="was">The 63 legacy <code>/services/*</code> redirect links<br><span class="mono" style="color:var(--muted)">Proposed replacement for the item above</span></td>
          <td class="tagc"><span class="rm paid">Already paid</span></td>
          <td class="why2">Considered as a substitute, then dropped: they sit in the same shared template as the Foundation Fix 404 repairs, so the same single edit clears both. It is already covered.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="was">XML sitemap regeneration &mdash; indexable URLs only<br><span class="mono" style="color:var(--muted)">Plan 02</span></td>
