          <td class="why2">Marking up reviews collected on third-party platforms as the site&rsquo;s own <code>aggregateRating</code> is outside Google&rsquo;s structured-data policy and risks a manual action. Self-serving <code>LocalBusiness</code> review markup has also not produced SERP stars since 2019, so the visible benefit would not have arrived either. Replaced by A3.</td>
