</section>

<section id="terms">
  <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-num">05</span><h2>What happens the first month</h2></div>
  <p class="lede">Two things drive the order. Conversion tracking goes first because it cannot be back-dated &mdash; every week it does not exist is a week that can only be reported in rankings. Then the fastest-moving item, so there is a number to show at the first report.</p>

