  <p class="lede" style="margin-top:24px"><strong>And the honest version of why this renews.</strong> The gap analysis identifies roughly fifteen clusters. The initial term delivers six. The remaining nine are the month-three conversation: here is what we found, here is what we built, here is what is left and what each one is worth. Renewal on a backlog, not on faith.</p>

  <div class="foot">
    <p><strong>One thing to settle before signing.</strong> The Google Business Profile and the website disagree about the practice&rsquo;s hours. Everything in workstream A inherits whichever version is correct &mdash; the schema, the citations and the profile all have to say the same thing &mdash; so the practice needs to confirm the real schedule in week one. It is the first question on the kickoff call.</p>
    <p><strong>What this plan assumes.</strong> That the Foundation Fix has shipped and been verified: the Sucuri challenge cleared, the 310 product-tag URLs suppressed, the Yelp merge filed, and the schema deployed. Workstream D in particular cannot start before the firewall is confirmed clear, because AI crawlers cannot execute the JavaScript challenge at all.</p>
